  "notes": "Corner-lot two-storey white/cream house (#ededdf) with orange terracotta hip roof (#c85e34), rooftop solar panels and skylights. Row of upper windows, some with diamond-pattern grilles; a dark-blue double entrance door. A lower single-storey right wing under its own terracotta hip roof. Frontage is a multi-colour concrete-block wall (brown/tan/grey banded, #b6a884) with a grey ornate arched metal vehicle gate and a grey panel pedestrian door; blue and red cars in the driveway, planters and a green bin, red-white kerb wrapping the corner. Sampled colours 2026-07-04."
